# Steps to install SASS on Windows

1. Opened Command Prompt and navigated to the project folder:
   cd path\to\alx-intermediate-frontend
   mkdir 0x03-sass_scss
   cd 0x03-sass_scss

2. Checked Node.js installation:
   node -v
   npm -v
   (Installed Node.js v20.16.0 from https://nodejs.org/en/download if not found)

3. Installed SASS using npm:
   npm install sass -v 3.7.4

4. Verified SASS installation:
   npx sass --version
